Subject: Cantor B1 Operator Policy Governance Bundle Verification P0 Requirements Analysis

@ [requirements_analysis_uuid] 59eac04c-27ff-4c47-9b4a-5700e513e444
@ [source_snapshot_uuid] 39915a21-c45a-4402-a573-d43346c1edd8

& [Need]
  + the packet compiler verifies nine descriptor shapes but intentionally never opens candidate material
  + A1 is the first dependency and must be verified before A2 through A9 can be composed
  + signature mathematics alone cannot establish operator identity custody revocation current validity or live consent

& [RequiredTransform]
  + exact predecessor evidence -> exact A1 descriptor -> raw-byte identity -> strict payload and envelope validation -> Ed25519 correspondence -> nonauthorizing receipt
  + every transition retains raw digest predecessor identity fixture class denial set unresolved authority list and zero-effect account

& [AcceptanceLogic]
  + no typed parse occurs before raw bytes match the A1 descriptor
  + no positive correspondence field may promote policy_governance_proved or execution eligibility
  + retained evidence and an independent verifier must reproduce the same receipt twice under strict bounds
